	(text "GRAPHICS RAM $D800-$DFFF: SLOT MODE (GFX-ON = 1) / DIRECT MODE (GFX-ON = 0)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5bbb296b-65f5-5086-9c0e-90175805ee76"))
	(text "NMUX = NAND(QC OR RCO, GFX-ON): 1 = the CPU address on the muxes' I1 side, 0 = the display (MA, RA). Slot\nmode: WRQ (IC44/A) holds a CPU write for the next slot, -WE = NAND(WRQ, NMUX, WEPH OR NOT GFX-ON, GWR), reads\nthrough the latch IC41. Direct mode: WRQ preset, -WE = NOT GWR, reads through IC55. R25 / R26: the text-only\nbuild only (README). IC44/B is held cleared: its Q = IN PC bit 3 (0 = the graphics chips are fitted)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bd758a5e-1232-522a-bb8f-cf7cfb5372a7"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
